@startuml
' ZHIYA v1.1 | 2026-11-04 | local PlantUML / Graphviz
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam dpi 220
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam packageTitleAlignment left
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam padding 6
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam monochrome true
hide empty members
hide empty description
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 25
state CREATED
state IN_PROGRESS
state FINISHED
state INTERRUPTED
[*] --> CREATED
note left of CREATED
创建前置条件：
权限与内容校验通过
end note
CREATED -down-> IN_PROGRESS : STARTED\n[授权与内容有效]\n/ 记录开始时间
CREATED -right-> INTERRUPTED : 放弃，内容撤回
IN_PROGRESS : 交互 [未到时且 revision 匹配]\n/ 更新进度
IN_PROGRESS -down-> FINISHED : 主动结束，正常到时，\n续写切换
IN_PROGRESS -right-> INTERRUPTED : 确认中断，内容撤回
FINISHED --> [*]
INTERRUPTED --> [*]

@enduml
